{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cfq7xx1EfcQUQobF9nrF9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Turn 3 of 10.**\n\nI follow the voice. It leads past the laundry lines to a small kitchen where a kettle is heating very slowly, one percent at a time: `[████░░░░░░] 41%`. It's the progress bar, and it is the one doing the counting.\n\n\"You're early,\" it says. \"Most people only look at me when I'm stuck at 99.\"\n\nI ask what it's loading. It thinks for a while (which, for a progress bar, means it doesn't move) and then admits it doesn't know. It was started a long time ago by a script that exited without waiting for it. Since then it has kept going because stopping halfway seemed rude.\n\nI sit down at the table. There are two mugs. One says `stdin` and the other says `stdout`. I pour tea into `stdout` and it shows up, warm, in the other mug, which feels right in a way I can't explain.\n\nThrough the kitchen window, the field of unused variables sways. `retryCount` has gone from 3 to 2.\n\nSeven turns left."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":420,"cache_read_input_tokens":17303,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":420},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"afe5c2dc-5a84-4fde-b688-39a4e5161f93","uuid":"d575b3f0-2401-4314-a7d3-09701409bfa5","timestamp":"2026-10-08T16:55:21.845Z","request_id":"req_011Cfq7xwkcTJZDqZMbJWBxg"}
